    text+=['## Rechecked previous results','','The previous independent acceptance and raw results are reused, not overwritten. Its 317 source hashes and 34 freeze/integration hashes were recomputed again at this closeout.','', '- U-Net filtered mIoU **0.9027725281222957** over 510 test images; full 513-image mIoU **0.9032296663464998**. Three train/test duplicates excluded from the filtered score; two train/validation duplicate pairs and broader source ancestry remain unresolved. Foreground label definition/ignore mask limit the metric.','- YOLO synthetic mAP50 **0.8981703397612487**, mAP50–95 **0.796430962799771** on 30 test images. Buffet zero support is excluded from supported-class metrics; partition has five GT instances and AP50 zero. Do not describe buffet performance as validated.','- Fifty historical layouts were independently replayed from raw polygons in FUNCTIONAL_V2. V1 false accepts for missing/NaN objectives and table-class relabelling were detected; new final validation rejects these poisoned outputs before successful persistence.','- Adaptive ablation is local versus global sampling within the same one-group selective problem. Recomputed mean stage delta -0.0011757742644689984 m and movement delta +0.0249609535033116 m; not a full selective-versus-global-reoptimization study.','- XAI V1 previously accepted stale measurements against tampered output; the new explanation is bound to request/response/layout and recomputed text/numeric evidence. No learned or causal explanation claim.','- One preexisting readiness CSV hash mismatch and five previously intentional living-control appends are documented in FUNCTIONAL_V2. Original baseline integrity is not conflated with readiness report immutability.','','## Remaining work by priority','']
